<article>
	<h1><span>Storefront: SKUs</span></h1>

	<ul class="nav">
		<li><a href="#overview">Overview</a></li>
		<li><a href="#column-headers">Column Headers</a></li>
		<li><a href="#toolbar">Toolbar</a></li>
		<li><a href="#sub-menu">Sub-menu Links</a></li>
	</ul>

	<section id="overview">
		<h2><span>Overview</span></h2>

		<p>This screen lists the SKUs of one product. It opens from the SKU count of a product in the
			<strong>Products</strong> list.</p>
		<p>The heading of the list reads &quot;SKUs for:&quot; followed by the name of the product. The name links to
			the editing screen of the product.</p>
	</section>
	<section id="column-headers">
		<h2><span>Column Headers</span></h2>

		<dl>
			<dt>Checkbox</dt>
			<dd>Check this box to select one or more items. To select all items, check the box in the column heading.
				After one or more boxes are checked, click a toolbar button to take an action on the selected item or
				items. Publish, Unpublish and Delete work with multiple items. Edit only works on one item at a time.
				If multiple items are checked and you press Edit, the first item will be opened for editing.</dd>

			<dt>Title</dt>
			<dd>The name of the SKU. If you may edit SKUs, the name links to the SKU's editing screen.</dd>

			<dt>State</dt>
			<dd>Shows whether the SKU is Published, Unpublished or Trashed. If you may change the state, click the
				icon to publish an unpublished or trashed SKU, or to unpublish a published one.</dd>

			<dt>Restrictions</dt>
			<dd>Shows &quot;restricted&quot; when the SKU is restricted by users. If you may edit SKUs, it links to
				the list of the SKU's restrictions.</dd>
		</dl>
	</section>
	<section id="toolbar">
		<h2><span>Toolbar</span></h2>
		<p>At the top right you will see the toolbar.</p>
		<p>The functions are:</p>
		<dl>
			<dt>Options</dt>
			<dd>Opens the Storefront configuration options in a pop-up window.</dd>

			<dt>Publish</dt>
			<dd>Publishes the selected SKUs.</dd>

			<dt>Unpublish</dt>
			<dd>Unpublishes the selected SKUs.</dd>

			<dt>New</dt>
			<dd>Opens the editing screen to create a new SKU for this product.</dd>

			<dt>Edit</dt>
			<dd>Opens the editing screen for the selected SKU. If more than one SKU is selected, only the first one
				will be opened. The editing screen can also be opened by clicking on the <strong>Title</strong> of the
				SKU.</dd>

			<dt>Delete</dt>
			<dd>Opens a confirmation screen for the selected SKUs. Check &quot;I'm positive. Go ahead and do the
				delete.&quot; and press <strong>Next</strong> to delete them. Pressing Next without the check cancels
				the delete.</dd>

			<dt>Help</dt>
			<dd>Opens this help screen.</dd>
		</dl>
	</section>
	<section id="sub-menu">
		<h2><span>Sub-menu Links</span></h2>
		<p>At the top left, you will see sub-menu options. The links are:</p>
		<dl>
			<dt>Products</dt>
			<dt>Collections</dt>
			<dt>Option Groups</dt>
		</dl>
	</section>
</article>
